{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.10.300","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.10.300","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.300","content_hash":"d83a5adec58e229c01b40a78b06232dd6c08ae0b7fe7464bdee059b17da5b0c3","heading":"Definitions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.300:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.300","text":"The following words and phrases, when used herein, shall have the meanings respectively ascribed to them:\n“Hydrant meter” shall mean the meter and appurtenances connected to a fire hydrant for the temporary use of water.\n“Meter” shall mean a device, connected to a water main, used to measure and record the rate of water flow. (Ord. 18650 § 1, 6-6-06. Code 1995 § 146-95.)\nCross References: Definitions generally, TMC 1.10.020 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"1e2ab778-576c-5542-8b95-e39b1b431305"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.300","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.300","content_hash":"1120b4097e1b8503cc0ce3ed477fa7e59c61e6f5483bacecb2e6d2ffd59d037e","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.300:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.300:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.300","text":"The following words and phrases, when used herein, shall have the meanings respectively ascribed to them:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"785ece73-b341-5847-a808-5131d05d13d3"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.300","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.300","content_hash":"